OL,3,GNEWSAVeteran councillor suspended by
OL,4,Aparty after 'social media
OL,5,Acommunication'
OL,6,
OL,7,FVeteran Belfast councillor Jim Rodgers
OL,8,Fhas been suspended by the Ulster
OL,9,FUnionist Party (UUP) pending the
OL,10,Foutcome of a "disciplinary process".
OL,12,FAccording to the party, it follows a
OL,13,Fcomplaint made to the UUP by a person
OL,14,Fregarding "social media communication".
OL,16,FIt is understood the communication was
OL,17,Fmade between Rodgers and a member of
OL,18,Fthe public in the last 12 months and
OL,19,Fthere is no Police Service of Northern
OL,20,FIreland (PSNI) involvement.
OL,22,FRodgers has been contacted for comment.
OL,23,APub: 17-NovQppppppppppppppppppppppppppp
